8le16ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le16ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le16ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "My weekend was an unbelievable event. I had an unimaginable &nbsp;Saturday evening.<br/>\nI went out to dinner, I went to a costume party at a dance club. At the club, I met the most amazing man. Now, I&rsquo;m a big girl, but for me, meeting someone in a club is unthinkable.<br/>"}, {"time": "18000", "image": "engenn8le16ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "I was dressed as a cat and I was having a great time dancing with Steve when I heard someone behind me talking in a strange language. I turned around and looked and I saw the most handsome man I had ever seen. He looked just like Bruce Lee. His costume was unusual. He wore big glasses, some make-up and dark colored clothes. I walked back to the table and when Steve went to the bathroom, Bruce Lee came over. He leaned in and asked me, &ldquo;Hi, do you speak Korean?&rdquo;<br/>\n&ldquo; Ah... No.&rdquo;<br/>\n&ldquo;Well, when I was talking to my friend, you glanced over. I thought maybe you spoke Korean.&rdquo;<br/>"}, {"time": "55500", "image": "engenn8le16ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "I smiled. Then he asked me some questions like:<br/>\n&ldquo;How long have you been such a good dancer?&rdquo; &ldquo; How long have you been a fan of cats?&rdquo; &nbsp;He asked me what I did and I told him I wrote a blog. Then he asked, &ldquo;How long have you been doing that?&rdquo; We talked some more, but I couldn&rsquo;t take my eyes off him. &nbsp;He was not unlikeable - at all. Finally, he smiled that amazing smile and asked, &ldquo;How long have you been this beautiful?&rdquo;<br/>\nI melted. It was magical.<br/>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}